{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ece1578931094a4a994dd5d604f3ad321f7bb304d1049bfa0a04f087253a557f", "ja": "急ぎ帰還したジェネシス。ジュリアと茜は\nマコトと激突。仲間を攻撃する姉を止めよう\nとする紬。そんな中、ジュリアを庇って茜が\n倒れる。ジュリアの嘆きがアミュレットを\n目覚めさせ、その力にマコトは敗れる。", "zh": "Genesis急忙赶回总部。茱莉亚和茜对上真\n展开激战，䌷则打算阻止姊姊攻击伙伴。\n过程中，茜为了保护茱莉亚而倒下。\n茱莉亚的悲怒让护身符觉醒，\n并借此力量打败了真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1000_006mak", "source_sha256": "4a79e87e5b39a6f160b29e91d59ea983dd2e32f50e3912039b7031352c3a9b0a", "ja": "初めまして、ザ・ファースト、ザ・ネクスト。\nそして……永遠に、さようなら。", "zh": "The First、The Next，两位好。\n然后……永别了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1001_se", "source_sha256": "55802282d7ca59cf9be989500ab8ae45d3318af12f07fdd365d5eb0e9b7b0b19", "ja": "ズドンッ！", "zh": "轰隆！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "14987cb169372545c41ef6b5b747bfac4419f2252e1a181d6119a1b62daae151", "ja": "きゃああああーーーっ！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊───！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "14987cb169372545c41ef6b5b747bfac4419f2252e1a181d6119a1b62daae151", "ja": "きゃああああーーーっ！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊───！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1004_006mak", "source_sha256": "954a463810c1b8d91a8868ddf4ca02bbcf0d3b20bb70b45a9ad26f806e07c678", "ja": "おっと……力加減、間違えちゃったな。\n君の獲物だったのに、ごめん、カオリ。", "zh": "糟糕……力道没控制好。\n抢了你的猎物，抱歉啊，歌织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1005_052kao", "source_sha256": "170bcbbcb0d6c0d25e53626af585631baa355a891402af3bd64f1b1d7903a29f", "ja": "追撃するぞ、マコト。……奴らの亡骸を踏み砕いた\nその時、この体もようやく『私』になる。", "zh": "真，继续追击……唯有踩碎她们的尸体，\n这具躯体才会成为真正的『我』。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1006_006mak", "source_sha256": "9b36bae0dda9bbe0cd551ff7cef2718bf454d31c770c3adff6a634bf3c893471", "ja": "ああ、わかってる。でも、もう二人とも\n死んでいるかもしれないけどね。……ん？", "zh": "嗯，在下知道。不过，她们两个\n搞不好已经一命呜呼啰……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "b135de3194501a372d21c6813ca13ccf3d3f9481de3e2e6fdce47254d5e8d170", "ja": "会いたかったぜ、『黒髪』ーっ！！", "zh": "我好想见你啊，『黑发』──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1008_023aka", "source_sha256": "047012fad2d8c483526e4abc0e12f01a17465abba3a23bc4ab07336c218c6455", "ja": "ちょっ、ひとりで突っ込んだらダメだって！？\nんもー、ジュリアンのあわてんぼうさん！", "zh": "喂！不可以自己一个人冲进去啦！！\n真是的～茱莉安你这个急性子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "786b01009351112509d31eeb1d2ff82fca7ce5052a252afbf4571ef9e42ff976", "ja": "っ……！？\n姉、さん……っ！", "zh": "唔……！？\n姊、姊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "7f3e15016d22c6db49c09c7c0cee616309ba06d98c4fa7736a4112bf7d52993d", "ja": "何っ！？　き、効いてないっ！？\nなんだ、このダークパワーは……！", "zh": "什么！？居、居然没用！？\n这股暗黑力量是怎么回事……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1011_006mak", "source_sha256": "d290b3cc88b3fc1b563bb9f6bd43923e06963a1463f9cbb140f1d7d98c411d6b", "ja": "誰だい、君達。ボクは今忙しいから、\nあまり長く遊んであげられないんだけど。", "zh": "你们几个是谁啊？在下正在忙，\n没什么时间陪你们玩耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "074e922703946f601c04a1ebae7828ba55703a6a3cbadcae98709da44f954505", "ja": "うわぁっ、『黒髪』だよ、つむりん！\nこのままじゃジュリアンが！　た、助けなきゃ……！", "zh": "唔哇！是『黑发』啊，䌷䌷！\n这样下去茱莉安很危险！得、得帮她才行……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1013_006mak", "source_sha256": "88ddf0bb0b5ac6f541b43d1f24624335940e5cb6c0293b4c970f27eeecbee5eb", "ja": "ん？　……ああ！　君は、極東にいたスパイの子だね。\nいいよ。なら今度こそ、殺してあげよう……。", "zh": "嗯？……对了！你是在远东当间谍的那个女孩。\n好啊，这次在下一定会送你上路的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1014_006mak", "source_sha256": "788bb05c8b0f92f1eb905b7e0b74a9014b7bdf93cc621b749851b137b61f73f0", "ja": "はあっ！", "zh": "喝啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1015_se", "source_sha256": "2b2ce4bd5813ecac9c273a17e7440ff3a9d097c13c6f5c17fc68ef09c20a1955", "ja": "ドゴォーンッ！", "zh": "轰隆──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1016_050jul", "source_sha256": "ffdc676b13925c33c2a70def15e9a02a37ceb6753765c631d24e23cd967acb1b", "ja": "ぐわああああーーーーっ！？", "zh": "唔哇啊啊啊啊────！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1017_023aka", "source_sha256": "6931f2120d2676441f47ea7d818264e57e1f2625ef6f4ba8d604b5c2ad6a6275", "ja": "ぎゃああああーーーーっ！？", "zh": "呀啊啊啊啊────！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "e50a8230836a86f024ab8638f87c9fb69a5957f82105ec2cad1a24c89d4a4b9b", "ja": "ジュリア！？　茜……！\nもうやめて、姉さん！　私の仲間を傷付けないで！", "zh": "茱莉亚！？茜……！\n姊姊，拜托你停手！别伤害我的伙伴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1019_051tmg", "source_sha256": "315e85c61b66cc2413bbf3b072b06525381a77664fa30b987fb700b15c1e542b", "ja": "姉さんは、正義のヒーローだったのに……！\nどうしてこんな事をするの！？", "zh": "姊姊你不是正义的英雄吗……！\n为什么要做这种事！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1020_052kao", "source_sha256": "d5aab0d9643be0df5d6a0e80a314f429fef9d548a9f2b866c6e8f0c1b23620fd", "ja": "貴様は……ん？\n……なんだ、この感覚は。今までと違う……？", "zh": "你是……嗯？\n……这是什么感觉？跟以往都不一样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "79a580d691710fb4c5a25c4bd0a94a3775236464f4bf9b705a7501342a8ddad2", "ja": "このヒーローは一体……そうか。\nこの体の記憶を辿れば、或いは……。", "zh": "眼前这个英雄到底是……对了，\n只要回溯这具躯体的记忆，或许就能……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1022_051tmg", "source_sha256": "15ae429562029440ed53a8da29a81d567bb2dd74b775d1163019707ca28c2562", "ja": "姉さん？\nもしかして……私のこと、覚えてないの……？", "zh": "姊姊？\n难不成……你不记得我了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1023_052kao", "source_sha256": "3b4bd7e5d93e041ca1f040929f04f89701f680cddd94097d615976b6b7733630", "ja": "正義のヒーローだと？　これだけの力を持ちながら？\n紬……成程、妹か。ならばこの手で葬ってやろう。", "zh": "你说我是正义的英雄？拥有这么强大的力量却是英雄？\n䌷……原来如此，是妹妹啊。那我就亲手送你一程吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1024_052kao", "source_sha256": "13107a53ea6f0556e757847167410dbaeaabf200c8c07b832e298808c745c2bd", "ja": "や……め、て……！", "zh": "住……手……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1025_052kao", "source_sha256": "1565c56ea9efde7d1ba0953aed5c6f74884a6c1255a3b671a8e64dfbb266a277", "ja": "ほう……妹を手に掛けたくはない、か。\nふふ、いいぞ。それでいい。", "zh": "哦……不想手刃亲妹妹是吧。\n呵呵，很好，这就对了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "3ce8e584978fdc480b00820679f43e426f4241d9b2550dc214ce05594ed334ff", "ja": "ね、姉さん……？", "zh": "姊、姊姊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1027_052kao", "source_sha256": "cebaf12695db7e8b9df28de5a0f4419d1f3e1c918727a3dd1bdb81c32b6405e6", "ja": "ザ・ファースト、ザ・ネクスト。そして妹……\nこの身に繋がる者こそ、屠るだけの価値と義務がある！", "zh": "The First、The Next还有妹妹……你们跟这具躯体\n的羁绊，让屠杀更具价值，也成为一种义务！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1028_052kao", "source_sha256": "8238a2d5f68372b2bd120bbc68771a72ad86c46acb61b811186fd7af4e0c3cce", "ja": "肉体に縋り付くエゴ、その残滓！\n姉の亡霊と共に、あの世に逝くがいい……紬！", "zh": "在这具躯体内苟延残喘的自我残渣！\n就该和你姊的亡灵一起上路……䌷！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1029_se", "source_sha256": "e11fac425b49b3df35f56eac4f7661dcd09bcb3628a41f3e04f299b5ac79f94d", "ja": "ザシュッ！！！", "zh": "咻！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1030_se", "source_sha256": "07c027f09d32948f16218edb7593aa71ea66d3ec2307091e44b21984bcf22166", "ja": "ドゴォッ！　バギャァッ！", "zh": "砰！啪叽！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "911a470f375453111f168e470b5fc826c1f2401b29c1ae09f9f93395b9a65595", "ja": "ぐ、うっ……！　くそっ！\nまだだ、まだ、やれる……グ、ガハッ！？", "zh": "唔、呜……！可恶！\n还没完，我还、可以……唔、呃啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1032_023aka", "source_sha256": "cfff86674d5c4f89cc6ab48d7f58cf42e1c823f93eb5486f5c298f9db50d1dfb", "ja": "うぐっ……も、もう、茜ちゃん人形もないよ……！\n大ピンチだよジュリアン！　ここは逃げたほうが……。", "zh": "唔呜……小、小茜娃娃也用光了……！\n现在真的很危险啊，茱莉安！小茜我们还是逃吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1033_050jul", "source_sha256": "2ec2890e68030fb5bea00cfb4c6541093ca526997bb1e7024daccfe2c7c1ddab", "ja": "アカネ、お前は先に逃げろ……！　あたしは……\nあたしは、ここでヤツを仕留めないと……！", "zh": "茜，你先逃……！我……\n我一定要在这里收拾她……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1034_050jul", "source_sha256": "0a5724a464a964e14e20dc8dfc2804ff7ce6a10f4e91be3feecb6e7f61090501", "ja": "クソ、キネティックパワーが足りない！\nアミュレットよ、あいつを倒す力をくれ……！", "zh": "可恶，动能威力不够！\n护身符啊，给我足以打败她的力量……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1035_050jul", "source_sha256": "d1d35d0b871b83ec6af268669a5d0c422a46dca16b7ae31043b7533acb9a32e6", "ja": "な、なんで反応しないんだ……？\nまさか、壊れたのか……ぐうっ！？", "zh": "为、为什么没有反应……？\n难道坏掉了……唔呜！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1036_006mak", "source_sha256": "9c37b3e348a0433ca4462666d2b9229ff0216d1a5ee251a7d9acc20107397655", "ja": "これ以上、無益に苦しむことはないよ。\nおやすみ、ヒーローズ。目覚めのない、永遠の眠りを。", "zh": "你们不会再白白受折磨了。\n两位英雄，晚安，在下让你们永远安息吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1037_se", "source_sha256": "43c681e448f3a473d7461ddbe9c64163ca428932d34ae269af1fef6cb3c6d170", "ja": "ズシュッ！！！", "zh": "咻！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1038_050jul", "source_sha256": "2de065d905430ff6e594532a94c32b37750b053c77983fef1ff3587412588473", "ja": "ぐっ……あ、アカネ！？\nバカ、あたしを庇ったのか……！？", "zh": "唔……茜、茜！？\n笨蛋，你干嘛保护我……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1039_023aka", "source_sha256": "92454cb4b9fe1b9b130a74c433657c4a90a65b323d95b61096bc21b4c6b094bc", "ja": "じゅ、ジュリアン……。\nだ、大丈夫だから……逃げ、て……早く……。", "zh": "茱、茱莉安……\n小、小茜没事的……你快、逃……快点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1040_050jul", "source_sha256": "b17985ff5bfe6c9f722772aa4c2421e9352da2eda5b79310e8aacc4d0279a5b1", "ja": "な、なんでだ！？　どうして！\nお前だけでも、逃げられたのに……！", "zh": "为、为什么！？你干嘛这么做！\n你明明可以自己逃走的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1041_023aka", "source_sha256": "a2574558226c0421bd46da60ba86697ea367f42356a46d21e468876f3ce7a56c", "ja": "や、やだなー、ジュリアン……茜ちゃん、友達は置いて\n逃げないよ……あ、友達じゃなくて仲間だっけ……。", "zh": "讨、讨厌啦～茱莉安……小茜，才不会抛下朋友\n自己逃跑呢……啊，不是朋友，是伙伴来着……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1042_050jul", "source_sha256": "6f28f3b8c848be9210707b0e855102c22f466fbe2e52681fbb8531e9b3e0866a", "ja": "アカネ！！　もういい、喋るな！\n……くそっ……！", "zh": "茜！！够了，你别再开口了！\n……可恶……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1043_006mak", "source_sha256": "347c4ac306efa197da9fe65ca19dd35019be74ea8423f856b610d85abc922547", "ja": "嘆かなくても大丈夫、君もすぐ彼女に会えるさ。\n後悔も絶望もない世界、永遠の……闇の中で。", "zh": "用不着感伤，你很快就会和她重逢了，\n在那个没有悔恨和绝望的世界，在永恒的……黑暗之中。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1044_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd963a2daed032b55410db8a449cbdd51f6314f77c22a52cde77b2c8c3fa42ff", "ja": "うっ……うわあぁぁぁぁーっ！！！！", "zh": "唔……唔哇啊啊啊啊啊──！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1045_006mak", "source_sha256": "4db7e107bab1898a0425769660d25ebc8e8cda29892a64f84dc9a8ba39d88e74", "ja": "……？\nなんだ？　アミュレット……？", "zh": "……？\n怎么回事？那护身符……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1046_se", "source_sha256": "1405e56e2001e202217bb4301b3d388780a0a922c52290333c2a7d41e99ed91a", "ja": "キイィィーーーーン！", "zh": "嗡────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
