{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1051_050jul", "source_sha256": "8935dceba187239fa35d437341c51734c235fb8c5ac1ff1a7d7355d590803ad8", "ja": "う、お……おおおぉぉぉっ！！\n『黒髪』いぃぃぃーーっ！", "zh": "唔、喔……喔喔喔喔喔喔！！\n『黑发』──────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1052_se", "source_sha256": "9f614deaae2f3c51e04ba19892ac803b7f8ca0c3dd40e0b24e3864abdfba5c72", "ja": "ドッゴォーーーーーンッ！", "zh": "轰隆─────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1053_006mak", "source_sha256": "75e0c8d35658f2e363da22d0b6b0c7561c4e9f6a2b265f26045d713faa81c9fe", "ja": "っぐ！？　へ、へえ……すごいな。\nボクの障壁を……破るなんて、ね……。", "zh": "唔！？哦、哦……挺厉害的嘛，\n竟然能……突破在下的防护罩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1054_006mak", "source_sha256": "ed9248ced01baa07725177855a706c0d7f2050519106eaa5095cd060e8dd3bbd", "ja": "あ………………ははっ。\nなんだ……意外に、呆気ないじゃ……ないか……。", "zh": "啊………………哈哈，\n什么嘛……没想到，在下居然这么……轻易就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
