{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0081_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0081_story_07_1056_050jul", "source_sha256": "a5c3ae385fb6f6cb21da5f5d6df9c51a0168f638b7c020885c29f90a06f18d72", "ja": "はぁっ……！　はぁ、はぁ、はぁ……。\nくそっ……アカ、ネ……ムギ……。", "zh": "呼……！呼、呼、呼……\n可恶……茜……䌷……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
